      "Additional Guidelines for Ads",
      "GENERAL GUIDANCE"
    ],
    "content": "✅ Ad creative that describes or shows the promoted product or service\n✅ Using the words like \"you/other” without referencing a personal attribute",
    "content_type": "example_compliant",
